{"title":"Glasswrought Colossus","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 44 Sand Elemental that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">corrode</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\">Special: carapaceFlat: 7 | regrowthFracPerSec: .015</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/fulgurite-shard\">Fulgurite Shard</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/glasswrought-colossus\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/glasswrought-colossus?lv=44\">Lv 44 <span>55</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/glasswrought-colossus?lv=45\">Lv 45 <span>4</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/glasswrought-colossus?lv=44\" title=\"Pick level 44\"><td><b>44</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>233</td><td>28.7</td><td>2,200</td><td class=\"muted\">699 · 40.2 · 6,600</td><td>55</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Storm-Buried%20Caravan\">Storm-Buried Caravan</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/glasswrought-colossus?lv=45\" title=\"Pick level 45\"><td><b>45</b></td><td>243</td><td>29.3</td><td>2,250</td><td class=\"muted\">729 · 41 · 6,750</td><td>4</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Storm-Buried%20Caravan\">Storm-Buried Caravan</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 2 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 2 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 411 total, 109–163 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"sand-core\" title=\"Sand Core - in 100% of 2 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 3 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/dd2f532fec666b02e71c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sand Core</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 2/2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"ogrewax-arms\" title=\"Ogrewax Arms - in 50% of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/dc8e655dbf47607bb61d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogrewax Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">50% · 1/2</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Good: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Storm-Buried%20Caravan\">Storm-Buried Caravan</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 19 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 2052, 842 <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 2007, 836 <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 2060, 820 <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"glasswrought-colossus\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/shatterheart\"><img src=\"data/img/c6160c3c691ea525e4ba.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Shatterheart</b><span>Lv 45</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Sand Elemental: <a href=\"#/monster/sand-elemental\">Sand Elemental</a> <span class=\"muted\">(38)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/dune-elemental\">Dune Elemental</a> <span class=\"muted\">(41)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/5937c516cba955676068.webp\" alt=\"Glasswrought Colossus\"></div><h3>Glasswrought Colossus</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>44 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 0–45)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Sand Elemental</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>233</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>28.7</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2200</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.2 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>40 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}